.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
*.log
# M4.1 style tile: the 1x lossless review renders are regenerated by design/style-tile/render.mjs (design QA reads them from disk); the @2x client WebPs are committed
/design/style-tile/style-tile-1440.webp
/design/style-tile/style-tile-390.webp
/design/style-tile/style-tile-390-en.webp
# M4.2: graded AVIF/WebP/JPEG renditions of the seed photos, regenerated by design/scripts/process-photos.mjs (thumbhashes are in the manifest)
/design/seed-photos/processed/

